    "title": "Lane restriction lifted after crash on I-380 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "COOLBAUGH TOWNSHIP, MONROE COUNTY (WBRE/WYOU)— A Wednesday afternoon crash backed up traffic along Interstate 380 (I-380) in Monroe County. The Monroe County Communications Center stated that a crash occurred Wednesday afternoon on I-380 Southbound near mile marker 6. Officials confirmed there are injuries, but the severity and number of injuries are unknown. According to 511PA.com , the crash occurred just south of Exit 8 PA 611 South/TO PA 423- Tobyhanna, and a lane restriction was lifted just after 6:00 p.m. Pennsylvania State Police are handling the crash. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to 28/22 News.",
